Each test builds its own graph and spawns `CoverageAuditor` to verify the
behavior the issue #95 fix-it demands: declared props not present in the
exercised list are reported as dead, total counts are aggregated across the
chain, and the walker visits every `PartOf` link.
"""

test "declared prop absent from exercised list is reported dead" {
